+## Supported currencies
+
+tally accepts amounts in the following currencies:
+
+| Code | Currency         |
+|------|-----------------|
+| USD  | US Dollar        |
+| EUR  | Euro             |
+| GBP  | British Pound    |
+| SGD  | Singapore Dollar |
+| JPY  | Japanese Yen     |
+| INR  | Indian Rupee     |
+
+All amounts are converted to USD at storage time using the rates in `tally/rates.py`.
+
 ## A note on scope
 
 This is a personal tool, not an accounting package. It does not do tax categories,
